        "### Phase 2: Feature Engineering & Target Transformation\n",
        "Real estate prices are heavily right-skewed, violating standard homoscedasticity assumptions\n",
        "required for linear modeling.\n",
        "\n",
        "To address this, I implemented a two-step optimization pipeline:\n",
        "1. Applied the Interquartile Range (IQR) method dynamically to clip extreme luxury outliers.\n",
        "2. Utilized a natural logarithmic transformation (`np.log1p`) on the target pricing column.\n",
        "\n",
        "Additionally, I engineered a custom `house_age` factor using vectorized NumPy logic to resolve\n",
        "an anomaly where unrenovated homes default to a year value of 0. Identifiers and pricing derivative\n",
        "metrics are explicitly dropped to eliminate data leakage.\n"
      ],
